# Product Launch Email Template

A clean, modern, and responsive HTML email template designed for product launches.  
Built with compatibility, readability, and conversion in mind.

![Email Preview](preview.png)

---

## Overview

This is a fully responsive product launch email template that works across major email clients.  
It’s designed to announce a new product, highlight key features, and drive users to take action (pre-order, learn more, or visit the website).

---

## Features

- Fully responsive design (mobile-first)
- Compatible with major email clients (Gmail, Outlook, Apple Mail, Yahoo, etc.)
- Clean and modern visual hierarchy
- Clear call-to-action buttons
- Easy to customize colors, images, and copy
- Inline CSS for maximum compatibility
- Dark mode friendly (where supported)
- Lightweight and fast-loading

---

